. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2000 to 2020, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

. 
.         * FE model
. 
.         * We run a FE model analysis with political_score as dependent variab
> le and the dummy variable d_daughter as the main independent variable
.         * Controls included: d_son  i.kids_variant  i.marital_status  years_e
> ducation employment_status
.         * Individual FE, Survey Year FE 
. global controls d_son  i.kids_variant  i.marital_status  years_education empl
